 ### Does Tomli-W sort the document?<a name="does-tomli-w-sort-the-document"></a>
 
-Not by default: it respects the order of the input data.
-Pass `sort_keys=True` to `tomli_w.dump` or `tomli_w.dumps` to write keys
-in sorted order at every level (inline tables included).
+Yes, by default: keys are written in sorted order at every level
+(inline tables included).
+Pass `sort_keys=False` to `tomli_w.dump` or `tomli_w.dumps` to respect
+the order of the input data instead.
 
